# Security & Privacy

**Forbidden patterns (analytics, tracking, network, permissions):** hexpal-project.mdc. HexPal requests ZERO system permissions.

## Permissions
- HexPal: zero permissions (NSColorSampler, KeyboardShortcuts — no Accessibility, no Screen Recording)
- Don't collect or transmit user data

## Privacy
- No analytics, tracking, or telemetry (hexpal-project)
- No data collection
- No network requests — app runs 100% locally (hexpal-project)

## Error Handling & Logging

### Logging Standards
- Log errors to console with clear messages
- Use appropriate log levels (debug, info, warning, error)
- Include context in error messages
- Don't log sensitive information

### Error Handling Rules
- Always use try-catch for error-prone operations
- Don't let errors crash the app
- Provide user-friendly error messages
- Log errors for debugging
